{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "007S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "SPACE_0003": "\\ ", "SPACE_0004": "\\ ", "SPACE_0005": "\\ ", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-characterize-epi-mono}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d2cdd54c91172842da7935e351b2e537dfc65808da525fec53dd82898c278104", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:30001acb98f37f0a6e8e78e718a520843c14b4ec21bc04f5a8afd49d044413ae", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a topological space.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Epimorphisms (resp.<SPACE_0001>monomorphisms) in the category of\npresheaves are exactly the surjective (resp.<SPACE_0002>injective) maps\nof presheaves.\n<STRUCT_0003> Epimorphisms (resp.<SPACE_0003>monomorphisms) in the category of\nsheaves are exactly the surjective (resp.<SPACE_0004>injective) maps\nof sheaves, and are exactly those maps which are surjective\n(resp.<SPACE_0005>injective) on all the stalks.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5f31c1d0713f8f675bc9442034ae58248693b90ad75ab1126e84e069f34e6d45", "unit_id": "tag:0H7H:statement"}
{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "007S", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b062070f3abc75c32f78bf3fc0cf7322b465acb3777b4d9f6278a9b3703879ce", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:0H7H:proof"}
{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "007S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$(\\mathcal{C}, F)$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0005": "$X$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\varphi : \\mathcal{F} \\to \\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0008": "$x \\in X$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{F}_x \\to \\mathcal{G}_x$", "MATH_0010": "$\\varphi$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-check-homomorphism-stalks}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8e033d0c764b03b27c2149366bc14a20046f81a1f24a9373e7d68d62c7bbdb8d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c9551fa449dbbc398473f608bdd354540a9a29c207240b776bf975b171ef44c9", "source_text": "let <MATH_0001> be a topological space.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a type of algebraic structure.\nSuppose that <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004> are sheaves on <MATH_0005>\nwith values in <MATH_0006>.\nLet <MATH_0007>\nbe a map of the underlying sheaves of sets.\nIf for all points <MATH_0008> the map\n<MATH_0009>\nis a morphism of algebraic structures,\nthen <MATH_0010> is a morphism of sheaves of algebraic structures.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d80bcf5c638968bbbdc6ab0ed33d00292a9fb7b6f0f95579e61b68cf652d6936", "unit_id": "tag:007W:statement"}
{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "007S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$U$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{F}(U) \\ar[r] \\ar[d] &\n\\prod_{x \\in U} \\mathcal{F}_x \\ar[d] \\\\\n\\mathcal{G}(U) \\ar[r] &\n\\prod_{x \\in U} \\mathcal{G}_x\n}\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-sheaf-subset-stalks}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-image-contained-in}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{example-application-lemma-image-contained-in}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ebed0156fb8caf17f188720cb1c5021205593c1adc7d36c2bc4835010961a5db", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:161b539c5d82f0655494235f3436c2c4bc24751a6db694a47783079ec4331f12", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an open subset of <MATH_0002>. Consider the diagram of\n(underlying) sets\n<MATH_0003>\nBy assumption, and previous results, all but the left vertical\narrow are morphisms of algebraic structures. In addition the\nbottom horizontal arrow is injective,\nsee Lemma <REF_0001>.\nHence we conclude by Lemma <REF_0002>,\nsee also Example <REF_0003>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:81c39c5f6a143f5f395bd13c547a01713e89b942a52d8049cb9ad48b40cca935", "unit_id": "tag:007W:proof"}
{"chapter": "sheaves", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "007S", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{modules-section-kernels}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:39e731493b7830ac35f6295e8c41844a949722cf2fb701004a65f3ad6a0ddf1d", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nShort exact sequences of abelian sheaves, etc will be discussed\nin the chapter on sheaves of modules. See\nModules, Section <REF_0001>.\n\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d78b79a96db55ecc1c4e12c53e508e8ce01b26a4d1592f82ad05f6e2704c5da2", "unit_id": "tag:007S:prose-0003"}
